invariant: INV-48
file: src/mlkem_avx2.c
catches: test/mlkem-builds.sh
reason: the copy's row sampler runs mlk_sample_groups on each block, one
  group a step with a branch on each candidate, in place of
  mlk_sample_groups_avx2. Every comparison passes, because the
  coefficients are the same, so the script compiles the copy for x86-64
  and requires a call of mlk_sample_groups_avx2 (docs/decisions.md 225).

--- old
            count[j] = mlk_sample_groups_avx2(&a->vec[j], count[j], block, groups);
--- new
            count[j] = mlk_sample_groups(&a->vec[j], count[j], block, groups);
